{ 0x1F4E, R"~({05}{sfx6829}{17}Good! Then it's settled!{18}\n{13}{12}We'll catch that Skull Kid and\nget Epona and your ocarina back!\n{12}It's Navi and Link, just like\nalways!)~" },
